    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45630" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">strūma</span></b> , ae, f.
		struo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a scrofulous tumor</i>, <i>struma</i>, <i><span class="en">Cels. 5,
				28, 7</span></i>; <i><span class="en">1, 9</span></i>
			<i>fin.</i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 8, 51, 77, § 206</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">22, 14, 16, §
				38</span></i>; <i><span class="en">26, 5,
				14, § 26 al.</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">qui exsecant pestem aliquam, tamquam strumam
					civitatis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Sest. 65, 135</span></i>
			; cf. sarcastically: Vatinii strumam sacerdotii <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διβάφῳ</span> vestiant, <i><span class="en">id. Att. 2,
				9, 2</span></i>.</div>
